{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17438","headline":"星名诗 · 权德舆","name":"星名诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚怀何所欲，岁晏聊懒逸。\n云翼谢翩翻，松心保贞实。\n风秋景气爽，叶落井迳出。\n陶然美酒酣，所谓幽人吉。\n自当轻尺璧，岂复埽一室。\n安用簪进贤，少微斯可必。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}